WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:05.000
<b>Shinjugamine
Girls’ School</b>

00:05.130 --> 00:06.920
<b>It's almost time for the Holy Tree Festival!</b>

00:06.920 --> 00:07.830
<b>G'morning.</b>

00:08.830 --> 00:11.290
<b>What's your class doing?</b>

00:09.210 --> 00:11.710
<b>Shinjugamine Girls’ School
Culture Festival
Holy Tree Festival</b>

00:21.710 --> 00:22.920
<b>Hoshimori.</b>

00:22.920 --> 00:26.080
<b>Donning their celestial suits with
the power of the Holy Tree,</b>

00:26.080 --> 00:30.920
<b>they stand as humanity's only hope
against the mysterious Irous invaders.</b>

00:31.670 --> 00:36.750
<b>And this, this is the story of both
their battles and their comradery.</b>

00:40.670 --> 00:46.710
<b>Now among the stars that stretch as far as the eye can see,
find the constellation of your dreams</b>

00:46.710 --> 00:55.130
<b>Bring your hearts together 
and someday it will come true</b>

01:03.460 --> 01:08.420
<b>Are you ready to run for it?</b>

01:08.880 --> 01:13.960
<b>The road is long, but you've 
got your friends with you</b>

01:14.380 --> 01:18.670
<b>Instead of just making faces and worrying</b>

01:18.670 --> 01:23.580
<b>Just go in head-first with a smile</b>

01:24.170 --> 01:29.630
<b>As hearts cross even in mere passing</b>

01:29.630 --> 01:32.330
<b>They will grow into deeper bonds</b>

01:32.330 --> 01:39.460
<b>Bring them together as one and find 
the power to take on the future</b>

01:40.130 --> 01:46.000
<b>Now look up to the stars as far as the eye can see
and keep chasing that dream</b>

01:46.000 --> 01:51.420
<b>That outreached hand will 
encourage you not to give up</b>

01:51.420 --> 01:56.920
<b>No matter how many hundreds of 
tries it takes, you're not alone</b>

01:56.920 --> 02:03.920
<b>You can do it, look up, 
there's surely a starry sky</b>

02:03.920 --> 02:06.750
<b>Your dreams will come true</b>

02:09.040 --> 02:14.000
<b>Episode 9
Holy Tree Festival</b>

02:14.000 --> 02:16.960
<b>Hoshimori Class</b>

02:15.290 --> 02:17.830
<b>I've got some good news for you all today.</b>

02:17.830 --> 02:20.180
<b>We just got permission for the Hoshimori Class</b>

02:20.180 --> 02:22.950
<b>to participate in the upcoming Holy Tree Festival.</b>

02:24.460 --> 02:26.000
<b>For really real?!</b>

02:26.000 --> 02:26.960
<b>Of course!</b>

02:27.330 --> 02:28.630
<b>Yipee!</b>

02:28.790 --> 02:32.080
<b>But I thought we weren't allowed to
because of possible Irous attacks...</b>

02:32.080 --> 02:34.630
<b>Well, we haven't seen all too many lately.</b>

02:34.790 --> 02:39.000
<b>And the school president said this will be
important for your school life.</b>

02:39.580 --> 02:41.750
<b>So stop worrying and just have some fun!</b>

02:42.630 --> 02:44.920
<b>Oh, I knew I always loved that prez of ours!</b>

02:45.250 --> 02:47.080
<b>What should we do then?</b>

02:47.330 --> 02:49.540
<b>Hmm, yeah...</b>

02:49.750 --> 02:52.170
<b>Can't go wrong with a café or something!</b>

02:52.170 --> 02:53.630
<b>I wanna do dodgeball!</b>

02:53.630 --> 02:54.210
<b>What?!</b>

02:55.670 --> 02:58.920
<b>We're supposed to offer a service,
not just play games.</b>

02:58.920 --> 03:00.880
<b>I'll play my hardest!</b>

03:01.330 --> 03:03.000
<b>Would you listen?</b>

03:03.380 --> 03:06.710
<b>Hey Misa-Misa, what did you 
do at your last school?</b>

03:06.710 --> 03:07.330
<b>Huh?</b>

03:07.330 --> 03:09.380
<b>C'mon, I wanna know, too!</b>

03:09.380 --> 03:10.880
<b>Well...</b>

03:10.880 --> 03:11.830
<b>Sorry, girls...</b>

03:12.170 --> 03:15.630
<b>It's already been decided that
you'll be putting on a play.</b>

03:15.630 --> 03:17.000
<b>WHAT?!</b>

03:17.250 --> 03:20.460
<b>We were already well past 
submission date, you see.</b>

03:20.460 --> 03:24.290
<b>So this was the only option left that didn't
interfere with any other class...</b>

03:26.000 --> 03:27.790
<b>So, a play?</b>

03:28.130 --> 03:30.130
<b>Hey, that sounds fun!</b>

03:30.130 --> 03:31.630
<b>Count me in!</b>

03:31.630 --> 03:34.380
<b>Kokomi says she wants to do it, too! Right?</b>

03:34.380 --> 03:36.040
<b>I never said that!</b>

03:36.040 --> 03:37.790
<b>What should we do then?</b>

03:37.960 --> 03:39.580
<b>What indeed...</b>

03:39.580 --> 03:42.170
<b>How about Romeo and Juliet?</b>

03:43.040 --> 03:46.290
<b>Asuha can be Romeo and I'll be Juliet!</b>

03:46.290 --> 03:47.080
<b>Absolutely not.</b>

03:47.080 --> 03:48.210
<b>What?!</b>

03:48.380 --> 03:50.330
<b>I wanna do a musical!</b>

03:50.330 --> 03:51.330
<b>Or a historical drama!</b>

03:51.330 --> 03:53.380
<b>Or Sannen Netaro.</b>

03:53.540 --> 03:55.290
<b>Let's do whatever-on-ice!</b>

03:55.290 --> 03:57.750
<b>That wouldn't be a play...</b>

03:58.920 --> 04:02.630
<b>Well then, I do think I could muster up
the backing of my family's estate</b>

04:02.630 --> 04:05.330
<b>and put on a Broadway style stage-</b>

04:05.330 --> 04:06.420
<b>Sorry, again...
and put on a Broadway style stage-</b>

04:06.920 --> 04:09.630
<b>But this is a school event, you see.</b>

04:10.170 --> 04:11.290
<b>Okay then!</b>

04:11.290 --> 04:17.380
<b>We don't really have much time left as it is,
so let's just forget anything over the top.</b>

04:17.670 --> 04:19.540
<b>Oh, you know what?</b>

04:19.540 --> 04:23.170
<b>I have a friend in drama club.
Maybe I should ask them for help?</b>

04:23.170 --> 04:24.830
<b>They might have spare costumes.</b>

04:25.080 --> 04:29.250
<b>Hmm, yeah. We can decide what to do
based on what costumes they have.</b>

04:29.250 --> 04:30.500
<b>Exactly!</b>

04:30.750 --> 04:33.250
<b>Sounds good to me.
I'll leave that to you then, Nozomi.</b>

04:33.250 --> 04:34.210
<b>Okay!</b>

04:36.080 --> 04:37.500
<b>This should be fun.</b>

04:41.750 --> 04:43.170
<b>So...</b>

04:43.170 --> 04:45.500
<b>Is this really all they had?</b>

04:47.250 --> 04:50.790
<b>I guess drama club already lent 
most of their stuff out...</b>

04:51.080 --> 04:53.500
<b>So I couldn't really press 
them for more than this.</b>

04:53.670 --> 04:56.420
<b>What sort of play can we do with these?</b>

04:56.420 --> 04:58.420
<b>Nothing really comes to mind, does it?</b>

04:59.580 --> 05:02.670
<b>Our best choice here is probably...</b>

05:03.040 --> 05:04.630
<b>This of course, right?</b>

05:06.830 --> 05:10.210
<b>But we don't really have the right costumes
for Little Red Riding Hood...</b>

05:10.210 --> 05:14.630
<b>Right, so we should just make up something
loosely based on Little Red Riding Hood.</b>

05:14.630 --> 05:16.000
<b>What about this swordsman?!</b>

05:16.000 --> 05:17.710
<b>Who's gonna be the swordsman?!</b>

05:17.880 --> 05:19.880
<b>We haven't really decided
that's gonna be a swordsman...</b>

05:19.880 --> 05:22.630
<b>I'll do it! Even if it's just a side role!</b>

05:22.630 --> 05:24.460
<b>'Kay, but...</b>

05:29.330 --> 05:30.580
<b>That's...</b>

05:30.830 --> 05:35.830
<b>It's fine! I'll make sure I'm the right size
in time for the play!</b>

05:35.830 --> 05:37.790
<b>That's not even possible!</b>

05:38.210 --> 05:39.330
<b>You're so tiny.</b>

05:39.710 --> 05:41.210
<b>You watch your language!</b>

05:44.290 --> 05:45.750
<b>My, oh my!</b>

05:51.750 --> 05:53.500
<b>Uhmm...</b>

05:54.330 --> 05:57.330
<b>Maybe... this is a bit much...</b>

05:58.080 --> 06:01.000
<b>We cannot put this on stage.</b>

06:01.920 --> 06:04.540
<b>That outfits gonna burst if she even moves!</b>

06:04.540 --> 06:07.250
<b>I-is one of us really going to wear that?</b>

06:09.040 --> 06:11.540
<b>Oh, everyone else will be just fine.</b>

06:11.540 --> 06:17.000
<b>I've got all your measurements memorized,
so I'll pick out something just right!</b>

06:17.170 --> 06:20.960
<b>Th-then why did you make me wear this?!</b>

06:24.000 --> 06:26.290
<b>Urara!</b>

06:26.290 --> 06:30.330
<b>Sorry, but for some reason I don't feel
compelled to cheer you up at the moment.</b>

06:31.750 --> 06:35.250
<b>Anyway. Let's leave the 
costume check as it is.</b>

06:35.250 --> 06:41.460
<b>Us third years will work out everyone's roles
and the script tonight.</b>

06:41.460 --> 06:43.000
<b>Oh yes, we will.</b>

06:43.330 --> 06:45.460
<b>We already got permission to use the stage.</b>

06:45.790 --> 06:47.960
<b>Tomorrow we start practicing!</b>

06:47.960 --> 06:49.040
<b>Okay!</b>

06:47.960 --> 06:50.460
<b>Hoshimori Class</b>

06:50.580 --> 06:51.790
<b>Hmm...</b>

06:51.790 --> 06:56.540
<b>But this doesn't really bring 
out Hinata's cheeriness.</b>

06:57.040 --> 07:01.920
<b>Oh, no, no, no, Sadone needs
a more glamorous role than this.</b>

07:01.920 --> 07:03.790
<b>And then Sakura...</b>

07:03.790 --> 07:05.830
<b>Renge, get over here.</b>

07:05.830 --> 07:07.330
<b>Oh, but I can't!</b>

07:07.330 --> 07:10.080
<b>All-nighters are no good 
for one's complexion!</b>

07:17.210 --> 07:18.250
<b>Hey.</b>

07:18.960 --> 07:22.000
<b>What sort of script do you 
think they're working on?</b>

07:22.170 --> 07:26.250
<b>If it's anything like the one for
the welcome party, well, I dunno...</b>

07:26.580 --> 07:30.290
<b>Yeah? I thought that one was fun.</b>

07:30.290 --> 07:33.380
<b>What? You really found that fun?</b>

07:35.170 --> 07:37.880
<b>Still, the Holy Tree Festival should be fun!</b>

07:38.580 --> 07:40.670
<b>I bet you're excited too right Misaki?</b>

07:40.830 --> 07:42.170
<b>I doubt it!</b>

07:49.580 --> 07:51.210
<b>Yeah, maybe.</b>

07:53.830 --> 07:56.080
<b>She's changed, huh.</b>

07:56.080 --> 08:01.540
<b>Indeed. She seems much 
friendlier than before!</b>

08:02.040 --> 08:03.830
<b>Yeah, definitely.</b>

08:06.040 --> 08:08.920
<b>Okay. Everyone's got their scripts?</b>

08:09.170 --> 08:11.920
<b>This might seem rushed, but 
let's just read through it.</b>

08:11.920 --> 08:14.290
<b>We'll work out the details as we go.</b>

08:14.290 --> 08:15.460
<b>Okay!</b>

08:17.920 --> 08:23.000
<b>Mic check. Mic check.</b>

08:23.250 --> 08:25.750
<b>So Anko is our narrator!</b>

08:25.750 --> 08:28.380
<b>If only I were, too...</b>

08:28.670 --> 08:30.250
<b>Here goes!</b>

08:31.170 --> 08:38.920
<b>Once upon a time, there was a girl who looked
just adorable in a little red riding hood.</b>

08:43.210 --> 08:48.460
<b>One day, a wolf crossed paths with
our Little Red Riding Hood.</b>

08:49.630 --> 08:52.170
<b>Oh my, what a cute little girl!</b>

08:52.170 --> 08:55.670
<b>Won't you join me for a bit of fun?</b>

08:57.080 --> 09:00.920
<b>But Little Red Riding Hood ran away,
like a scared little rabbit.</b>

09:02.830 --> 09:05.170
<b>The wolf was struck with grief.</b>

09:05.170 --> 09:13.000
<b>Poor little Renge, I mean, poor ol' me,
I just wanted get a little close...</b>

09:13.000 --> 09:18.170
<b>But then three little pigs happened upon her.</b>

09:18.670 --> 09:21.330
<b>Hiya! I'm a little piglet!</b>

09:21.580 --> 09:24.580
<b>Oink, oink! Oink, oink!</b>

09:24.790 --> 09:26.500
<b>Well, goodness me...</b>

09:26.500 --> 09:29.080
<b>Why do I have to play this part?</b>

09:29.080 --> 09:30.960
<b>Oh, how adorable!</b>

09:31.670 --> 09:34.420
<b>The wolf was suddenly rejuvenated.</b>

09:34.830 --> 09:36.630
<b>Oh, little piggies!</b>

09:36.630 --> 09:39.630
<b>Won't you have some fun with me?</b>

09:40.290 --> 09:41.500
<b>Oh my...</b>

09:41.500 --> 09:44.170
<b>The pigs built up walls.</b>

09:44.420 --> 09:48.540
<b>But they were no match for the wolf.</b>

09:49.290 --> 09:50.790
<b>Roar!</b>

09:51.250 --> 09:56.750
<b>The three little pigs scrambled away,
as fast as their little hooves would carry them.</b>

09:58.170 --> 10:02.170
<b>Why does no one understand my love...?</b>

10:03.170 --> 10:06.420
<b>The wolf was once again struck with grief.</b>

10:07.750 --> 10:08.960
<b>Miss Wolf!</b>

10:08.960 --> 10:09.790
<b>Huh?</b>

10:10.210 --> 10:15.040
<b>But next a flower-loving 
goat crossed her path.</b>

10:15.670 --> 10:17.790
<b>Cheer up, Miss Wolf!</b>

10:17.790 --> 10:19.500
<b>The flowers,</b>

10:19.500 --> 10:25.630
<b>they will surely wash away your sorrows.</b>

10:25.630 --> 10:28.380
<b>Oh, what a darling you are.</b>

10:28.380 --> 10:29.920
<b>A real angel!</b>

10:30.420 --> 10:35.790
<b>And so the wolf and the goat
travelled off into the stormy night.</b>

10:36.170 --> 10:38.630
<b>Hey, uhmm...</b>

10:38.630 --> 10:40.210
<b>Oh come on, lighten up!</b>

10:40.500 --> 10:43.130
<b>What?! What kind of play is this?</b>

10:43.130 --> 10:44.500
<b>This is ridiculous!</b>

10:44.670 --> 10:47.580
<b>No, this avante-garde style...</b>

10:48.210 --> 10:49.210
<b>It's perfect!</b>

10:49.210 --> 10:50.580
<b>Sh-Shiho?!</b>

10:50.580 --> 10:52.750
<b>Uhmm, Asuha?</b>

10:52.750 --> 10:54.630
<b>I'm really sorry.</b>

10:54.630 --> 10:59.000
<b>After listening to Renge's suggestions,
something just sort of clicked with Anko, you see...</b>

10:59.000 --> 10:59.880
<b>What?!</b>

11:02.210 --> 11:05.080
<b>I'm sure you all have a lot 
of opinions you want to voice.</b>

11:05.080 --> 11:08.080
<b>But, this might be our chance!</b>

11:08.080 --> 11:10.210
<b>Let's make this a fun performance!</b>

11:10.210 --> 11:12.460
<b>You sure you aren't overdoing it, Asuha?</b>

11:18.710 --> 11:19.580
<b>Ouch!</b>

11:19.580 --> 11:21.250
<b>Are you okay, Subaru?</b>

11:23.630 --> 11:26.750
<b>Okay! Now just sit still.</b>

11:28.130 --> 11:32.130
<b>If you can hem like this then why not
fix my swordsman outfit?</b>

11:32.130 --> 11:34.210
<b>Are you still on about that?</b>

11:34.210 --> 11:36.420
<b>No, that's not it.</b>

11:36.420 --> 11:40.000
<b>At this rate you'll never get across
the true sadness of these three little pigs!</b>

11:40.000 --> 11:43.290
<b>What are they even sad about?</b>

11:43.290 --> 11:46.040
<b>We only have a single line a piece...</b>

11:46.040 --> 11:48.290
<b>You give them some advice too, Kanon!</b>

11:48.290 --> 11:49.040
<b>Wha-?</b>

11:49.040 --> 11:50.830
<b>M-me...?</b>

11:51.790 --> 11:54.290
<b>Is this everything we needed to get?</b>

11:54.540 --> 11:56.420
<b>Yeah. Probably.</b>

11:56.420 --> 11:58.830
<b>Okay! Now for what we've 
all been waiting for!</b>

11:58.830 --> 12:00.170
<b>Let's go!</b>

12:05.210 --> 12:07.920
<b>Don't worry about how much it cost.</b>

12:07.920 --> 12:11.920
<b>Asu-chi told me this was 
for doing the shopping!</b>

12:13.130 --> 12:15.960
<b>Don't tell me you don't like crepes?</b>

12:15.960 --> 12:17.540
<b>Oh, no...</b>

12:25.710 --> 12:26.670
<b>It's so good...</b>

12:26.670 --> 12:27.880
<b>Right?</b>

12:28.540 --> 12:31.080
<b>This is the best shop in town.</b>

12:32.000 --> 12:34.540
<b>I'll give you a bite of 
mine, so lemme try yours!</b>

12:34.540 --> 12:35.500
<b>Wha-?!</b>

12:39.420 --> 12:40.830
<b>That's really good!</b>

12:40.830 --> 12:42.830
<b>Okay then, have some of mine!</b>

12:51.130 --> 12:52.830
<b>You too, Kokomi!</b>

12:55.960 --> 12:57.710
<b>Your turn, Urara.</b>

13:00.210 --> 13:04.420
<b>Sheesh, Urara, you've got whipped cream
all over your face.</b>

13:08.630 --> 13:10.960
<b>You're next, Misaki. Have a bite.</b>

13:22.880 --> 13:25.170
<b>Oh you lovely little Hoshimori girls.</b>

13:25.630 --> 13:30.790
<b>You trust in one another,
putting your lives on the lines for others...</b>

13:31.790 --> 13:34.040
<b>How marvelous indeed.</b>

13:34.580 --> 13:40.670
<b>And now their smiling faces
will fade into fear and hopelessness...</b>

13:41.790 --> 13:45.420
<b>Don't you want to be there to see it?</b>

13:50.000 --> 13:53.960
<b>Sakura Fujimiya (1st Year JH)
Birthday: March 27th
Sign: Aries
Blood Type: AB
Measurements: 77/56/80
Height: 149cm
Weight: 38kg
Hobby: Watching traditional performances
Favorite Way to Relax: Hot springs
Favorite Food: Soft things
Ideal Downtime: Hard things</b>

13:54.040 --> 13:58.000
<b>Hinata Minami (1st Year JH)
Birthday: April 15th
Sign: Aries
Blood Type: O
Measurements: 76/55/74
Height: 141cm
Weight: 35kg
Hobby: Chatting
Favorite Way to Relax: Chatting
Favorite Food: Omurice
Ideal Downtime: Green peppers</b>

13:58.000 --> 14:00.000
<b>Would you care for some...</b>

13:58.000 --> 14:00.210
<b>Holy Tree Festival</b>

14:00.210 --> 14:02.670
<b>Holy Tree Festival</b>

14:02.670 --> 14:03.040
<b>Welcome!</b>

14:03.040 --> 14:04.380
<b>It's really good!
Welcome!</b>

14:04.380 --> 14:04.880
<b>It's really good!</b>

14:06.630 --> 14:09.170
<b>Hey, let's go there next!</b>

14:09.170 --> 14:10.080
<b>Good idea.</b>

14:17.170 --> 14:19.920
<b>Renge looks so beautiful!</b>

14:19.920 --> 14:20.750
<b>She does.</b>

14:20.750 --> 14:23.000
<b>Futsal Club
Butler Café</b>

14:23.130 --> 14:25.790
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting, madam.</b>

14:26.330 --> 14:29.580
<b>Have you been brought everything you ordered?</b>

14:30.000 --> 14:32.920
<b>Do relax and enjoy yourself.</b>

14:37.210 --> 14:40.250
<b>I wish I got to wear that outfit instead...</b>

14:40.920 --> 14:42.250
<b>Excuse me!</b>

14:42.460 --> 14:44.500
<b>Coming! Just a moment!</b>

14:48.960 --> 14:51.080
<b>They all seem to be enjoying themselves.</b>

14:51.380 --> 14:52.250
<b>Indeed.</b>

14:52.250 --> 14:54.960
<b>The Hoshimori girls seem 
to be having fun as well.</b>

14:56.040 --> 14:58.420
<b>Ms. Yakumo! Ms. President!</b>

14:59.460 --> 15:02.790
<b>We don't have enough participants
in our Miss Shinjugamine contest.</b>

15:00.580 --> 15:05.580
<b>Miss Shinjugamine
-All Ages
-All Grades
Anyone is welcome to join.
The winner will get a spectacular award!</b>

15:02.790 --> 15:05.130
<b>There aren't any age restrictions, you know!</b>

15:05.670 --> 15:07.710
<b>We hope to see you there!</b>

15:08.210 --> 15:10.170
<b>Hey! No running in the hallways!</b>

15:10.540 --> 15:12.040
<b>Sheesh...</b>

15:12.040 --> 15:13.790
<b>Hmm? Ms. President...?</b>

15:13.790 --> 15:16.500
<b>O-oh, it's nothing!</b>

15:16.500 --> 15:17.920
<b>Uh-huh...</b>

15:20.790 --> 15:24.250
<b>I guess even the Irous know
today's not a good day for them.</b>

15:28.710 --> 15:29.920
<b>Finished!</b>

15:30.460 --> 15:31.790
<b>Wanna try some?</b>

15:31.790 --> 15:34.290
<b>Sorry, I'm on a diet at the moment...!</b>

15:34.290 --> 15:35.670
<b>Yeah, me too...</b>

15:36.920 --> 15:38.750
<b>Miki, it's time!</b>

15:38.750 --> 15:40.170
<b>Oh! Coming!</b>

15:43.710 --> 15:46.630
<b>The chorus is on stage right now.</b>

15:47.040 --> 15:50.670
<b>Up next is dance club, 
and after that it's us.</b>

15:50.960 --> 15:52.880
<b>Everyone start getting ready.</b>

15:52.880 --> 15:54.580
<b>Sakura and the others aren't here.</b>

15:54.580 --> 15:55.500
<b>Huh?</b>

15:55.920 --> 15:58.750
<b>Oh, sorry there. Guess we're late.</b>

15:58.750 --> 16:01.710
<b>What were you doing? I 
told you we were tight on-</b>

16:06.540 --> 16:09.040
<b>Sakura! Don't scare me like that!</b>

16:09.040 --> 16:12.920
<b>Sorry! Softball club was 
running a haunted house.</b>

16:12.920 --> 16:15.130
<b>And we were helping out.</b>

16:16.880 --> 16:20.540
<b>I've come for vengeance...!</b>

16:22.790 --> 16:25.880
<b>What's a "ven gence" anyway?</b>

16:25.880 --> 16:28.580
<b>Where did you even come up with that line...?</b>

16:29.000 --> 16:30.170
<b>Asuha!</b>

16:30.170 --> 16:33.750
<b>Oh sheesh. She's out cold.</b>

16:33.750 --> 16:38.250
<b>Oh nooo! Somebody better 
give her mouth to mouth!</b>

16:40.420 --> 16:42.830
<b>Now's not the place, you.</b>

16:42.830 --> 16:44.080
<b>I was so close!</b>

16:45.250 --> 16:47.290
<b>They'll be on stage soon.</b>

16:48.290 --> 16:49.540
<b>Here, I'll take over.</b>

16:49.540 --> 16:51.000
<b>Thanks!</b>

16:51.330 --> 16:54.960
<b>That concludes Dance Club's
creative dance performance.</b>

16:54.960 --> 16:58.250
<b>Next up we have a play 
by the Hoshimori Class.</b>

16:58.250 --> 17:00.250
<b>Hmm? Where's the president?</b>

17:00.250 --> 17:02.670
<b>Huh? Now that you mention it...</b>

17:05.920 --> 17:14.380
<b>Once upon a time, there was a girl who looked
just adorable in a little red riding hood.</b>

17:17.790 --> 17:20.080
<b>I'm Little Red Riding Hood!</b>

17:20.080 --> 17:25.080
<b>Today I'm heading out to bring
bread and wine to my grandmother!</b>

17:25.580 --> 17:31.130
<b>Suddenly, a wolf crossed paths
with Little Red Riding Hood.</b>

17:31.580 --> 17:34.330
<b>Oh my, what a cute little girl!</b>

17:34.790 --> 17:37.000
<b>What are you doing out in this old forest?</b>

17:37.290 --> 17:39.750
<b>Carrying a handgun for self-defense!</b>

17:39.750 --> 17:41.080
<b>Huh? No one told me about that!</b>

17:41.080 --> 17:42.130
<b>Can I shoot you?</b>

17:42.130 --> 17:43.330
<b>Noooo!</b>

17:44.460 --> 17:46.460
<b>This is looking good, Kanon!</b>

17:46.460 --> 17:47.960
<b>Y-yeah...</b>

17:47.960 --> 17:50.960
<b>It's not quite what I 
was expecting, though...</b>

17:51.790 --> 17:53.460
<b>Boom!</b>

17:57.460 --> 18:01.040
<b>She's just so cute that I 
brought her here with me!</b>

18:01.040 --> 18:04.130
<b>Oh my, you must be so tired.</b>

18:04.420 --> 18:06.540
<b>Well, it's certainly unique...</b>

18:17.500 --> 18:20.420
<b>I guess I've still got it in me.</b>

18:21.880 --> 18:23.880
<b>Wh-what's the matter?</b>

18:24.290 --> 18:25.750
<b>Ms. President, we've got trouble.</b>

18:27.420 --> 18:32.500
<b>Oh my! I'm just going to eat you up,
Little Red Riding Hood!</b>

18:32.500 --> 18:33.920
<b>Stop right there!</b>

18:36.920 --> 18:38.920
<b>Daddy!</b>

18:41.130 --> 18:44.960
<b>I know I still got to wear a kimono,
but this part is just too much...</b>

18:44.960 --> 18:47.670
<b>My! What a handsome samurai!</b>

18:47.670 --> 18:49.920
<b>You dare to run amok in our village?</b>

18:49.920 --> 18:52.420
<b>You insolent beast!</b>

18:52.420 --> 18:54.330
<b>Daddy!</b>

18:54.630 --> 18:56.880
<b>Your deeds cannot go unpunished!</b>

18:56.880 --> 18:59.040
<b>You've detected Irous-like 
readings on campus?</b>

18:59.040 --> 19:03.920
<b>Yes. And a more powerful type
than we've ever seen before!</b>

19:07.170 --> 19:08.290
<b>Misaki!</b>

19:11.380 --> 19:13.040
<b>Who the heck are you?!</b>

19:15.630 --> 19:17.210
<b>You mean that's...?!</b>

19:17.210 --> 19:19.420
<b>We need to evacuate everyone!</b>

19:19.420 --> 19:21.580
<b>Doing that would just throw 
the place into panic.</b>

19:21.580 --> 19:22.710
<b>You're right.</b>

19:22.710 --> 19:25.920
<b>And we wouldn't be dealing with
just one or two casualties...</b>

19:27.580 --> 19:31.580
<b>We have no choice but to take care of it
without alerting any of the students.</b>

19:32.710 --> 19:34.330
<b>Time to stop playing around.</b>

19:35.500 --> 19:36.500
<b>They're fast!</b>

19:38.710 --> 19:42.130
<b>The Hoshimori Class sure knows
how to put on a performance...</b>

19:42.130 --> 19:43.000
<b>Yeah...</b>

19:50.880 --> 19:53.250
<b>You get 'em, Hoshimori!</b>

19:53.250 --> 19:54.960
<b>Beat 'em up!</b>

19:55.750 --> 19:58.750
<b>The audience still thinks 
this is part of the play!</b>

19:59.170 --> 20:00.170
<b>We can pull this off!</b>

20:05.130 --> 20:07.000
<b>You... Who are you?</b>

20:10.960 --> 20:11.710
<b>Shoot!</b>

20:24.830 --> 20:27.420
<b>Heh, Misaki isn't the 
only member of Hoshimori!</b>

20:27.420 --> 20:28.380
<b>Yeah!</b>

20:28.380 --> 20:30.330
<b>You can't escape now!</b>

20:32.170 --> 20:35.000
<b>That should suffice as an introduction.</b>

20:39.380 --> 20:40.380
<b>Hold it!</b>

20:42.130 --> 20:43.330
<b>It vanished?</b>

20:43.670 --> 20:46.250
<b>What on Earth is going on?</b>

20:48.380 --> 20:50.500
<b>That was so cool, Miki!</b>

20:50.500 --> 20:52.670
<b>Hoshimori, you're the best!</b>

20:52.670 --> 20:53.830
<b>Now's our chance!</b>

20:53.830 --> 20:55.750
<b>Narrate something to close out the play!</b>

20:55.750 --> 20:57.540
<b>Narrate what?!</b>

20:57.540 --> 20:59.000
<b>Anything!</b>

21:01.330 --> 21:05.250
<b>A-and so the forest was safe once again.</b>

21:05.630 --> 21:10.630
<b>The Hoshimori Class continued the fight
for world peace.</b>

21:10.630 --> 21:12.960
<b>And they all lived happily ever after.</b>

21:14.920 --> 21:16.330
<b>I was not ready for that...</b>

21:16.330 --> 21:19.330
<b>I wasn't sure we'd make 
it for a second there.</b>

21:20.420 --> 21:21.710
<b>Misaki.</b>

21:22.460 --> 21:23.790
<b>Are you hurt?</b>

21:23.790 --> 21:26.250
<b>N-no. I'm fine.</b>

21:26.540 --> 21:28.040
<b>Are you all okay?</b>

21:28.040 --> 21:31.330
<b>Yup! The rest of us are perfectly fine.</b>

21:31.330 --> 21:33.290
<b>That was great work.</b>

21:33.290 --> 21:36.170
<b>Thanks to you all we had 
not a single casualty.</b>

21:36.170 --> 21:38.420
<b>The stage got trashed, though.</b>

21:38.420 --> 21:39.710
<b>I'll explain everything...</b>

21:44.670 --> 21:45.920
<b>It couldn't be...</b>

22:12.500 --> 22:18.960
<b>Things should be moving, 
but they feel stopped</b>

22:18.960 --> 22:25.290
<b>I contemplate alone, pretending to understand</b>

22:25.290 --> 22:31.710
<b>But with the end of each 
twinkle reason draws away</b>

22:31.710 --> 22:37.500
<b>Reflected in my pupils as running noise</b>

22:37.500 --> 22:44.040
<b>Consciousness trapped 
away in a lonely rondeau</b>

22:44.290 --> 22:47.710
<b>When it's held up, make your escape</b>

22:47.710 --> 22:53.080
<b>And let us perform together</b>

22:53.210 --> 23:00.040
<b>There's no one to decide but you yourself</b>

23:00.040 --> 23:06.210
<b>Whether right or wrong, it 
will all start to seem fine</b>

23:06.210 --> 23:13.000
<b>One over the other, if you believe 
it will come true someday</b>

23:13.000 --> 23:21.830
<b>The blank music score will be 
filled with a one of a kind</b>

23:22.080 --> 23:25.080
<b>Ring out melody</b>

23:27.380 --> 23:30.670
<b>Yipee! We finally get to go home
for a change, huh, Sakura!</b>

23:30.670 --> 23:31.670
<b>Yeah, yeah.</b>

23:31.670 --> 23:34.170
<b>When I get home I'm gonna 
hang out with my brothers!</b>

23:34.170 --> 23:35.790
<b>Next time: "Family"!</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:38.630
<b>Sakura, what are you gonna do back home?</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:41.040
<b>Next Episode
Family
Leave it to me! Woof!</b>

23:38.630 --> 23:39.880
<b>Nap.</b>
